---
import SidebarLayout from '../layouts/SidebarLayout.astro';
---
<SidebarLayout title="Changelog">
  <header>
    <div slot="title">
      <div slot="content">
        <h1>Changelog</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div slot="description">

      Version history for the NativeUI documentation site. Each release lists new features, updates, and breaking changes with links to relevant pages.

    </div>
  </header>

  <section>

    <!-- ── 0.7.14 ── -->

    <div class="changelog-version">
      <h2>0.7.14 <span class="changelog-date">— March 2026</span></h2>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="danger">New</n-badge> New Pages</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/components/noodles">Noodles</a> — Declarative SVG noodle canvas</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Zero-config <code>&lt;n-noodles&gt;</code> element wrapping <code>NoodleController</code></li>
                <li>Children declare ports via <code>data-noodle-port</code>, element handles SVG overlay automatically</li>
                <li>3 demos: static connections, editable drag-to-connect, styled (curves, colors, animation)</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/traits/mentionable">Mentionable</a> — <code>@</code> mention trigger for contenteditable inputs</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Caret-anchored popover with filtered team members, accent-colored <code>@Name</code> tags</li>
                <li>3 demos: basic textarea, n-input, combined slash + mention</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/traits/backtick-wrappable">BacktickWrappable</a> — Inline code wrapping via backtick pairs</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Type <code>`hello`</code> to auto-wrap in styled <code>&lt;code&gt;</code>, or select text and press backtick</li>
                <li>2 demos: basic backtick wrap, combined slash + mention + backtick</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/traits/link-pasteable">LinkPasteable</a> — Paste URL to create hyperlinks</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Select text, paste a URL — selected text becomes a styled hyperlink</li>
                <li>2 demos: basic link paste, combined all four text commands</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/components/feed">Feed</a> — Generic scrollable feed container</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Auto-scroll, pin detection, virtual scroll windowing (10k items)</li>
                <li>4 demos: basic, bottom-anchored, auto-scroll + pin, virtual scroll</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="accent">Updated</n-badge> Updates</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Text Commands system — <code>TextTriggerController</code> base class</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li><code>SlashCommandController</code>, <code>MentionController</code>, <code>BacktickWrapController</code>, <code>LinkPasteController</code> share a common base</li>
                <li>All controllers coexist on the same input without conflict</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/containers/pane">Pane</a> — Initial size and scrollable demos</n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/packages/n-editor">Editor</a> — <code>&lt;n-editor&gt;</code> element demos</n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>5 new Phosphor icons: <code>arrows-merge</code>, <code>cloud</code>, <code>export</code>, <code>keyboard</code>, <code>monitor</code></n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>CSS architecture audit — migrated all inline style overrides and boundary violations to component token API</n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.150</code> + <code>native-ai@1.0.78</code></n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/icons">Icon page</a> — searchable all-icons grid with <code>getIconNames()</code> API</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Real-time search filter with match count badge</li>
                <li>CSS grid layout with hover effect and monospace labels</li>
                <li>Page converted to co-located folder pattern</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/styles/colors">Colors page</a> — modernized with n-select dropdowns + restructured Figma export (T0228)</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Theme and Scheme <code>&lt;n-select&gt;</code> dropdowns for live switching</li>
                <li>4 export options: Figma (computed), Figma (computed + semantic), CSS (computed), CSS (all)</li>
                <li>Figma Variables JSON restructured with nested folders — no more group/variable conflicts</li>
                <li>Expanded <code>TOKEN_TO_FIGMA</code> with state variants (hover, active, disabled) for all ground categories</li>
                <li><code>GROUP_DOCS</code> documentation comments in exported CSS</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/showcase/a2ui-builder">A2UI Builder</a> — synced with upstream (system prompt, seed pool, preview animation)</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Updated system prompt with full trait documentation, CSS color guidance, CSS shapes, inline SVG patterns</li>
                <li>18 randomized seed prompts replace 4 hardcoded starters (tic-tac-toe, kanban, music player, pricing table, etc.)</li>
                <li>Preview mount scale + fade animation on schema apply</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Inline display migration (T0227) — removed no-op <code>[inline]</code> attribute from all controls</n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Listbox popover audit (T0229) — all <code>&lt;n-listbox&gt;</code> inside selects/comboboxes confirmed to have <code>popover</code> attribute</n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.162</code></n-header>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── 0.7.13 ── -->

    <div class="changelog-version">
      <h2>0.7.13 <span class="changelog-date">— March 2026</span></h2>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="danger">New</n-badge> New Pages</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/showcase/a2ui-builder">A2UI Builder</a> — Conversational UI builder powered by the A2UI protocol</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Describe a UI in natural language and watch it render live as native components</li>
                <li>Multi-pane layout: chat, preview, concepts, schema, component map, system prompt editor</li>
                <li>Resizable split panels with coordinated drag handling</li>
                <li>Model picker: Claude Haiku 4.5, GPT-5 mini/nano, GPT-4.1 mini/nano, mock mode</li>
                <li>Trait system awareness — 28 traits (draggable, flippable, confettible, etc.) via Controller wrapping</li>
                <li>Gap report UI with warning-colored borders and confetti celebration</li>
                <li>Claude Code prompt generation — export implementation instructions from chat context</li>
                <li>Chart component in registry with full API surface</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="accent">Updated</n-badge> Updates</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Noodleable demo — Port hover states and UX polish</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Port indicator hover/drag/drop-ready CSS states with pulse animation</li>
                <li>Separate snap and guides toggles (both off by default)</li>
                <li>Add button follows during drag, instant <code>pointerdown</code> response, 300ms forgiving hide delay</li>
                <li>Magnet snapping glow effect on <code>[magnet-snapping]</code></li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>8 new Phosphor icons registered</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li><code>brackets-curly</code>, <code>brain</code>, <code>crosshair</code>, <code>file-code</code>, <code>flask</code>, <code>lightbulb</code>, <code>list-checks</code>, <code>record</code></li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.85</code>, <code>native-ai@1.0.28</code>, <code>native-dashboard@0.4.21</code>, <code>native-code@1.0.8</code>, <code>native-data-viz@0.2.5</code></n-header>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── 0.7.12 ── -->

    <div class="changelog-version">
      <h2>0.7.12 <span class="changelog-date">— March 2026</span></h2>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="danger">New</n-badge> New Pages</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/traits/noodleable"><code>Noodleable</code></a> — SVG noodle connections between DOM elements</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>5 interactive demos: static connections, flow builder with MagnetController, curve styles (bezier/step/straight), disabled state, and event log</li>
                <li>Full API reference: port declaration, adapter attributes, programmatic methods, events</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/controllers/store-controller"><code>StoreController</code></a> — Reactive key-value store with remote fetch</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Two consumption patterns: direct (imperative) and provider (<code>&lt;n-controller provides&gt;</code>)</li>
                <li>Lazy signal creation per key, <code>load(url)</code> for JSON fetch, loading/error signals</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="accent">Updated</n-badge> Updates</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/a2ui/a2ui">A2UI Protocol</a> — 10 new preset demos wired</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Vitals, Medication List, Referral Form, ICD-10 Lookup, Patient Intake, Prior Auth, Care Plan, Step Wizard, Confirm Dialog, Settings Panel</li>
                <li>All 20+ preset buttons now functional with Card root + Header/Body/Footer pattern</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Noodleable demo — Flow node colors fixed</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Switched from raw semantic tokens to <code>intent</code> attributes with button-level resolved tokens</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.66</code></n-header>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── 0.7.11 ── -->

    <div class="changelog-version">
      <h2>0.7.11 <span class="changelog-date">— March 2026</span></h2>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="danger">New</n-badge> New Features</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Admin pages — Org management interfaces</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li><a href="/admin/members">Members</a> — invite, change roles, remove org members</li>
                <li><a href="/admin/groups">Groups</a> — create groups with tier-based access</li>
                <li><a href="/admin/permissions">Permissions</a> — tier permission matrix + grant overrides</li>
                <li><a href="/admin/registry/llm">LLM Registry</a> and <a href="/admin/registry/connectors">Connectors</a> — content object CRUD</li>
                <li>Admin nav in org dropdown menu (owner/admin only)</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>6 new fun traits — Physics and visual effects</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li><a href="/traits/tossable">Tossable</a> — physics-based throw with momentum and bounce</li>
                <li><a href="/traits/flippable">Flippable</a> — 3D card flip between front/back faces</li>
                <li><a href="/traits/parallaxable">Parallaxable</a> — holographic tilt following pointer</li>
                <li><a href="/traits/confettible">Confettible</a> — confetti particle burst</li>
                <li><a href="/traits/magnetizable">Magnetizable</a> — snap-to-guide alignment</li>
                <li><a href="/traits/css-inspectable">CSSInspectable</a> — 3D layer inspector (Alt+click)</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Four-layer data model — Identity, Permissions, Content Schemas, Registries</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>10 new database tables: organization, member, invitation, group, permission, grant, contentType, contentObject, and more</li>
                <li>better-auth organization plugin with tier-based access (owner/admin/user/preview)</li>
                <li>Permission resolution with baseline tiers + explicit grant overrides</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3>Breaking Changes</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Trait option attributes — <code>data-trait-*</code> namespace</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>All trait options renamed: <code>draggable-axis</code> → <code>data-trait-draggable-axis</code></li>
                <li>Prevents collisions between trait options and component API attributes</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="accent">Updated</n-badge> Updates</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.45</code>, <code>native-app@0.3.19</code></n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li><code>n-app-panel</code> body scroll delegation — header/footer stay fixed</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── 0.7.10 ── -->

    <div class="changelog-version">
      <h2>0.7.10 <span class="changelog-date">— March 2026</span></h2>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="danger">New</n-badge> New Features</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/a2ui/a2ui">A2UI Session Layer</a> — Multi-agent sessions and protocol adapters</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Session manager, surface registry with single-owner write gating</li>
                <li>Protocol adapters: Direct, A2A (Google), AG-UI</li>
                <li>4 new demo pages including tic-tac-toe multi-agent game</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><code>.n-chat-starter</code> — Starter surface preset for chat seed + structured input</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li><code>[compact]</code> variant for sidebars and small cards</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="accent">Updated</n-badge> Updates</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.39</code>, <code>native-app@0.3.17</code>, <code>native-chat@0.5.24</code>, <code>native-a2ui@0.2.3</code></n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Codebase audit — ~460 rule violations fixed across 54 files</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>12 Hard Rules enforced: scoped selectors, <code>:where()</code> overrides, attribute API only</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><code>n-app-panel</code> — Semantic <code>&lt;n-header&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;main&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;n-footer&gt;</code> sub-containers</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Pinned header/footer with scrollable main, CSS custom properties for padding and max-width</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3>Breaking Changes</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/containers/stack"><code>&lt;n-stack&gt;</code></a> — Flex-basis and gap defaults changed</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li><code>flex-basis</code>: <code>100%</code> → <code>0%</code> — stacks share space proportionally</li>
                <li>Default gap widened from <code>space × 2</code> to <code>space × 4</code></li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/containers/header"><code>&lt;n-header&gt;</code></a> — Default block padding doubled</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Use <code>padding="tight"</code> to restore compact headers</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/components/select"><code>&lt;n-select&gt;</code></a> — Dropdown aligns flush with trigger edge</n-header>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3>Fixes</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/traits/draggable"><code>DragController</code></a> — Grid support for slot and drop modes</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Proper 2D coordinate detection for <code>axis: 'both'</code> layouts</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── 0.7.9 ── -->

    <div class="changelog-version">
      <h2>0.7.9 <span class="changelog-date">— March 2026</span></h2>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="danger">New</n-badge> New Components</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header><a href="/components/chart"><code>&lt;n-chart&gt;</code></a> — SVG charting component</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Line, bar, scatter, and sparkline chart types across three usage tiers</li>
                <li>Reactive data store with auto-detected scales, crosshair + tooltip interactions</li>
                <li>10 OKLCH color palettes (default, vivid, pastel, earth, ocean, sunset, forest, neon, mono, accessible)</li>
                <li>Reference lines, average lines, stacked/grouped/horizontal modes</li>
                <li>Comprehensive docs page with 20 interactive demos</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="accent">Updated</n-badge> Updates</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.22</code>, <code>native-app@0.3.12</code>, <code>native-chat@0.5.12</code>, <code>native-tokens@0.5.10</code></n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Coordinated release across all <code>@nonoun/*</code> packages</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header><code>n-gripper</code> — Now auto-registered</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Included in <code>@nonoun/native-ui/register</code> since 0.7.17 — manual registration removed from <code>setup.ts</code></li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Collapsed sidebar — Selected highlight removed</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Dark circle/pill highlight on the active section icon in collapsed mode removed — icon color change is sufficient</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── 0.7.8 ── -->

    <div class="changelog-version">
      <h2>0.7.8 <span class="changelog-date">— March 2026</span></h2>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="danger">New</n-badge> New Features</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Authentication — Email/password + Google OAuth</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Powered by <code>better-auth</code> with Drizzle adapter on Turso</li>
                <li>Functional <a href="/auth/login">login</a> and <a href="/auth/register">register</a> pages</li>
                <li><a href="/account/settings">Account settings</a> — profile, password, and account deletion</li>
                <li>Optional auth — anonymous browsing fully supported</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>User-scoped preferences — DB-synced settings</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Theme, sidebar state, and nav group preferences follow the user across devices</li>
                <li>Cookie-based fallback for anonymous users</li>
                <li>Preferences auto-migrate from cookies on first login</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Resizable panels — Main content, inspector, and chat</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Drag handles between panels for custom layout widths</li>
                <li>Panel sizes persist across page navigations</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="changelog-section">
        <h3><n-badge size="xs" intent="accent">Updated</n-badge> Updates</h3>

        <div class="changelog-cards">
          <n-container>
            <n-header>Ecosystem upgrade — <code>native-ui@0.7.8</code>, <code>native-app@0.3.5</code>, <code>native-chat@0.5.2</code>, <code>native-a2ui@0.1.5</code></n-header>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Sidebar footer — Auth-aware user menu</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Shows user avatar and name when authenticated</li>
                <li>Account settings and sign-out in dropdown</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>

          <n-container>
            <n-header>Rule #9 — No CSS classes on <code>n-*</code> elements</n-header>
            <n-body>
              <ul>
                <li>Use <code>id</code>, <code>aria-label</code>, or contextual selectors instead</li>
              </ul>
            </n-body>
          </n-container>
        </div>
      </div>

